			description: ["Rails are going to be your first option for getting around fast pre-petroleum, this pack has railcraft which makes crafting lots of them very easy, as well as making it so you don't need powered rails constantly at the cost of having to either electrify your rails, or run steam locomotives which require coal and water"]
